WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
In Regular hours, change Monday’s opening time from 7:00 to 8:30.
Choose Publish changes.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.480
Review the old and new hours, then choose Next.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.960
Keep Website widgets selected.
Select an Instagram post and a Facebook post.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.640
Preview the artwork for Instagram and Facebook.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.760
Confirm the three destinations and choose Publish.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.280
The website preview updates and both social previews are ready.
The demo stays in this browser.
